# shield/leaf: the Leaf shield (P2c wave 2, SHIELDS; form8): the Sylvan soldiers' and bandits' shield (PLAN Inventory).
# Long and pointed at both ends like a leaf, widest a little above the middle; a metal rim lit on its top-left edges,
# the field lit as a convex face, the Sylvan device the leaf's own veins: a midrib groove down the middle (region N:
# the T6 runes breathe in it), two pairs of veins sweeping up from a small boss (region G). Keys and layers as the
# kite's (STYLE_P2 25.5): rest, guard, block (a size up), lie (anchor pivot), back (slung, anchor neck); bash and ride
# appended by add_keys.py. Written by the SHIELDS area's gen_shapes.py from hand-drawn masks (shade.py) and checked by
# eye at 1x, 3x and 8x. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role shield form8
layer shield
anchor gripL
keys shield
tags overlay
legend R field 1
legend S field 2
legend T field 3
legend F device 2
legend J device 3

legend Q glow 2
legend X glow 3
legend W glow 4
legend U glow 1


legend ( plume 0
legend < plume 1
legend > plume 2
legend ^ plume 3
legend ] metal2 4
legend [ metal2 0
legend ; leather 0
legend : leather 1
legend = leather 2
legend + leather 3

